{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1611.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"2cf299b9db82240fc03c5e3aeca137dae387b6b9aadfc396c17215c632e680b3","ja":"数十分後……","zh":"数十分钟后……","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1611.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"c17c92dd969a64ea14f39ea4bda501f06deea6d25244db4481b8e4c6ad3c7a20","ja":"あっ、莉緒！　ねえ、聞いて聞いて、\n●●●●プロデューサーに香水を……。","zh":"啊，莉绪！呐，听我说听我说，\n●●●●制作人把香水给……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1611.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"ebb52b3d86e02b15323c09a45bf1ec24f52fcecb50ac9f5f2ba0b5cd235fb89f","ja":"はぁ～…………。","zh":"哈啊～…………。","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1611.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"66045c9e13e8395c78df0a078211f05025d4ef56477a066999c89153b1c12669","ja":"どうしたの？　莉緒、\nこの世の終わりみたいな顔しちゃってるよ。","zh":"怎么了？莉绪，\n你脸上一副世界末日般的表情哦。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1611.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"c99c2d144801e498651dd91de1dffbc57537a5ad7ad3eeb2e8f2f8157cc34d49","ja":"ねぇ、聞いてよ、美希ちゃん！\n●●●●プロデューサーくんってば、ひどいのよ！","zh":"美希，你听我说嘛！\n●●●●制作人真的很过分哎！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1611.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"2aded30bf94083e1de74071760422fe7a663ea45962c4bda26f0119543736b31","ja":"あのね、昨日、おそろいの香水を買ったでしょ？\nそれを今日、つけてきたの。","zh":"那个啊，昨天不是买了同款的香水吗？\n我今天喷了那个哦。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1611.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"3386e510bc8edad609f200d79e3bb52d27bf97bebdd2ddc09e9a77230538887c","ja":"それでさっき、●●●●プロデューサーくんに\n声をかけようとしたら……。","zh":"所以刚才正想跟●●●●制作人打个招呼，\n结果……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1611.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"dc8717829848ccc082c79bcbccab0a5efe9a2da444659f232b4465221fdab95c","ja":"「美希？　あ、莉緒だったか。すまない」\n……って！","zh":"“美希？　啊，是莉绪啊。抱歉”\n……才怪啊！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1611.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"2d19e9425bd1ff980f0295d2c9b7219869bd8c8fc3a26efe43c4205446b34c30","ja":"あっ、もしかして……ミキも同じ香水つけてて、\nちょっと前にお話ししたから、そのせいかもなの！","zh":"啊，难道说……美希也喷了同样的香水，\n刚才跟她说了会儿话，说不定是因为这个呢！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1611.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"44454b2f92682820399220a568b8efadb9b465e23c4dc55ca586aaac489bb623","ja":"えっ、美希ちゃんもつけてたの！？\nそれは、間違われるわけね……。","zh":"诶，美希也戴了吗！？\n难怪会被认错呢……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1611.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"eb31ea3ee53c01bff5f91156b4aae37d8e40396958e797be7f416ef82f27a666","ja":"ミキが先に会ってたから、\nこの香りはミキのだって、覚えちゃったんだね。","zh":"因为先见到了美希，\n所以就记住这个香味是属于美希的了呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1611.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"18d7e8cfb99670d4114a1b67d2d2ece2e5dda4cdf4ff12d0ac9bc6e54cd052ee","ja":"はぁ……仕方ないとはいえ、やっぱり悔しいわ！\nこうなったらリベンジよ！","zh":"哈啊……虽说是没办法的事，但果然还是好不甘心啊！\n既然这样，一定要赢回来！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1611.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"17b37d40d3022be2b4c1d4b88554afadd20a07e83f10ddafa53cab91e68a193a","ja":"もっと私にぴったりの香水をブレンドして、\n私の香りだって、覚えてもらうんだから！","zh":"调制出更加适合我的香水，\n一定要让人记住这就是我的香味！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
